    {
      "kind": "you",
      "subject": "Eliyahu i tokim meri long Sarepta",
      "rationale": "Eliyahu i skruktoket direk long meri — ol tok i kamap long ol imperatif."
    },
    {
      "kind": "addition",
      "subject": "⟨em⟩",
      "rationale": "Tok Pisin i laikim objekt; tok long ples bilong אליה i no gat nem yet."
    },
    {
      "kind": "substitution",
      "subject": "kuk bilong pias",
      "rationale": "עגה em i wanpela kuk raun ol i wokim long paia — 'kuk bilong pias' i holim piksa, 'kek' i no holim."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Na Eliyahu i tokim ⟨em⟩: No ken pret; go, wokim olsem tok bilong yu; tasol wokim bilong mi klostu long wanem: wanpela smol kuk bilong pias long stat tru, na yu bringautim bilong mi; na bilong yu na bilong pikinini man bilong yu, yu wokim bihain tru.",
